{"id":28,"date":"2026-06-28T15:37:00","date_gmt":"2026-06-28T15:37:00","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/floens-demo-new.local\/tower-garden-growing-resource-guide-copy-3\/"},"modified":"2026-06-29T13:45:34","modified_gmt":"2026-06-29T13:45:34","slug":"wall-cladding-stones-are-changing-the-way-modern-elevations-look","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/wall-cladding-stones-are-changing-the-way-modern-elevations-look\/","title":{"rendered":"Wall Cladding Stones Are Changing The Way Modern Elevations Look"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"blog-card__text blog-card__text--one wp-block-paragraph\">The exterior of a building creates the very first impression, and in modern architecture, wall cladding stones have become one of the most popular ways to make that impression feel premium and timeless.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Unlike traditional painted walls, natural stone cladding adds texture, depth, character, and architectural elegance that instantly elevates the entire appearance of a space. Whether used for villa elevations, entrance walls, feature facades, office exteriors, or luxury interiors, wall cladding creates a stronger visual statement.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Another reason homeowners and architects prefer stone cladding is durability. Natural stone surfaces handle weather exposure better while requiring minimal long-term maintenance.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"blog-card__text blog-card__text--one wp-block-paragraph\">At <strong>Jain Stones &amp; Tiles<\/strong>, we offer premium wall cladding collections designed for customers who want surfaces that feel luxurious while remaining durable enough for everyday use.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img fetchpriority=\"hig